  "body": "Uses (5 charges).\n➡️ If Eyes Through the Veil is ready, spend 1 charge: <b>Investigate</b> (<wil>). After you reveal a chaos token for this test, you may reveal 1 additional token. If you revealed an additional token this way and the test is successful, discover 1 additional clue at your location. If a non-⭐ symbol token is revealed during this test, exhaust Eyes Through the Veil.",
